<ContentPage title="About zyvento" description="Simple, focused online tools that help you finish everyday tasks with less friction." eyebrow="About us">
  <section><h2>Useful tools, without the noise.</h2><p>zyvento is being built as a home for fast, practical browser tools. We start with a word counter because a simple task should have a simple experience: open the page, paste your text, and get a clear result.</p></section>
  <section><h2>Our approach</h2><p>We care about speed, clarity, accessibility, and transparent behavior. The word counter works locally in your browser, requires no account, and explains how its counting rules work.</p><p>As the site grows, each tool will keep the same focus: solve one problem well, respect your time, and avoid unnecessary setup.</p></section>
  <section><h2>Questions or feedback?</h2><p>We’d like to hear what would make the tools more useful. Visit the <a href="/contact-us/">contact page</a> to get in touch.</p></section>
</ContentPage>
